<BusinessAnalyticsLegalLayout title="Cookie policy" description="How this dashboard uses browser storage and how you can manage optional storage." eyebrow="COOKIES & STORAGE">
  <h2>1. Current implementation</h2><p>The dashboard does not currently load analytics or advertising trackers. It uses browser local storage to remember your theme, display preferences, privacy choice and locally saved workspace data. Local storage is not the same as an HTTP cookie, but this policy groups the controls together so the choices are clear.</p>
  <h2>2. Necessary storage</h2><p>Necessary storage helps preserve core interface preferences, such as theme and accessibility options. These preferences are stored on your device and can be removed by clearing this site's data in your browser.</p>
  <h2>3. Optional analytics and advertising</h2><p>Optional analytics and advertising storage are not installed in this preview. If these tools are added in the future, the project should document the provider, purpose, retention period and consent behavior before enabling them.</p>
  <h2>4. Your choices</h2><p>You can record a necessary-only choice, reject optional storage or review the current configuration in <a href="/business-analytics/privacy-settings">Privacy settings</a>. These options save a preference in browser storage; they do not control trackers operated by another site after you follow an external link.</p>
  <ul><li><a href="/business-analytics/cookies/essential">Essential storage details</a></li><li><a href="/business-analytics/cookies/necessary">Necessary storage details</a></li><li><a href="/business-analytics/cookies/reject">Reject optional storage</a></li></ul>
  <h2>5. Clear your choice</h2><p>To reset a stored preference, use your browser's site-data controls. A future production settings screen could add a dedicated reset action.</p>
  <div class="legal-note">Cookie and consent requirements vary by location. Have this policy reviewed for the jurisdictions in which the product will be offered.</div>
</BusinessAnalyticsLegalLayout>
